{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Pjs9n7RgQ7t34hwv9ns6wn","type":"tool_result","content":"# Unreleased\n\n## Features\n- Add `--ignore-parent` option to override `--no-ignore-parent`, see #1958 (@tmchow)\n- Add `--exact` option to match the entire filename exactly (literal, non-substring).\n\n## Bugfixes\n- Handle invalid working directories gracefully when using `--full-path`, see #1900 (@Xavrir).\n- Fire the \"search pattern contains a path separator\" diagnostic for any pattern containing `/`, not just patterns that happen to name an existing directory. Preserves the legacy Windows behaviour that also flags native `\\` separators when the pattern resolves to a real directory. See #1873.\n- Fix bug where passing \"-\" as a directory argument didn't actually search that directory, see #849 (@Sean-Kenneth-Doherty).\n\n# 10.4.2\n\n## Bugfixes\n- Fixed performance regression due to `--ignore-contain`; see #1913 and #1914\n\n# 10.4.1\n\nThis is just a re-release of 10.4.0 due to an issue with the 10.4.0 release.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f955e374-1120-4cee-93cd-a369d4e5dfdb","uuid":"2824d762-0b6a-470c-bf31-66f2cf2fdc57","timestamp":"2026-10-18T17:57:25.805Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Unreleased\n\n## Features\n- Add `--ignore-parent` option to override `--no-ignore-parent`, see #1958 (@tmchow)\n- Add `--exact` option to match the entire filename exactly (literal, non-substring).\n\n## Bugfixes\n- Handle invalid working directories gracefully when using `--full-path`, see #1900 (@Xavrir).\n- Fire the \"search pattern contains a path separator\" diagnostic for any pattern containing `/`, not just patterns that happen to name an existing directory. Preserves the legacy Windows behaviour that also flags native `\\` separators when the pattern resolves to a real directory. See #1873.\n- Fix bug where passing \"-\" as a directory argument didn't actually search that directory, see #849 (@Sean-Kenneth-Doherty).\n\n# 10.4.2\n\n## Bugfixes\n- Fixed performance regression due to `--ignore-contain`; see #1913 and #1914\n\n# 10.4.1\n\nThis is just a re-release of 10.4.0 due to an issue with the 10.4.0 release.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Pjs9n7RgQ7t34hwv9ns6wn","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
